slots.  Given that inserting
one in a  primary slot renumbers the internal SCSI controller I agree.

Can anyone give me an idea why the 1020 in the secondary slot is sooooo
slooooow.  Is DEC PCI bridge
that bad, or is it a conflict with the 1020?

Also, has anyone tried the KZPCM-DA in the 600au, or an AlphaServer 600?



