The Portable Object Compiler (P.O.C.) is a Free Software utility to
compile "Objective-C" into "C".

It's a small precompiler that sits in front of the native (Digital Unix)
C compiler.

Version 1.9.7 of the P.O.C. has improved support for Digital Unix (for
some platform specific things, such as shared (dynamic) libraries on
D.U.).

The package is available from http://cage.rug.ac.be/~stes/compiler.html.



