> that are generaly available for the OSF/1 4.0d environment. 

A number of profilers are provided by Digital UNIX V4.0D - see the
hiprof, monitor, pixie, and uprofile man-pages and the Programmer's
Guide. A system-wide profiler is also available as a beta-quality 
advance developers kit - see http://www.research.digital.com/SRC/dcpi/

The Performance Manager is also available for Digital UNIX V4.0 - see
http://www.unix.digital.com/unix/sysman/perf_mgr/

These tools are available only as binaries.



