	  can be nested to 32 levels.  cpp support in Digital UNIX
	  remains in place and fully supported.

	- A new DCL qualifier (/CONSTANT); a new switch on Digital
	  UNIX (-constant); to define a Pascal constant from the 
	  command line.  This makes the new conditional compilation 
	  feature even more powerful.

