> > : > I'd like to know which program do you recommend for backup on DAT tapes
> > : > (OSF1 V3.0)? I'm currently using cpio.

For system backups (the whole file system) you should use vdump or dump. I
consider vdump better, because it can backup any file system recognized by the
OS (AdvFS, UFS, NFS, ...) and dump backs up only UFS. Some people like dump
because it has a similar command rdump, for network backups, but that can be
achieved with vdump and rsh (see some previous postings).

For archiving data you should use tar, pax, cpio, ...

Nix.





